{"unit_id":"jinxiqinghuan__dsh-retry-policy#card-zh","repo":"jinxiqinghuan/dsh-retry-policy","commit":"6b3d3fa135935e7c4844bfd4f263da20e6577e6a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"模型重试策略是一款面向 DSH Web 的模型失败重试插件，通过 bundle 补丁接管模型请求错误处理并提供设置页。它允许配置有限或无限重试、重试次数、固定/线性/指数等待曲线、等待上限与抖动，也可选择参与重试的失败码并优先采用提供方 Retry-After。插件写入兼容的重试事件和会话投影，并支持取消等待及设置即时保存，适合需要按服务响应调整模型失败恢复策略的 DSH 用户。设置页配置保存在本机 profile；无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:17-47","lib/host.js:198-290","lib/client.js:1445-1474"]}
{"unit_id":"jinxiqinghuan__dsh-retry-policy#card-en","repo":"jinxiqinghuan/dsh-retry-policy","commit":"6b3d3fa135935e7c4844bfd4f263da20e6577e6a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Model Retry Policy configures failed model request retries in DSH Web. Set retry limits, finite or unlimited mode, fixed, linear or exponential backoff, delay caps, jitter, failure codes, and provider Retry-After. The settings page saves changes through the host route; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:17-47","lib/host.js:198-290","lib/client.js:1445-1474"]}
