{"unit_id":"jinxiqinghuan__dsh-retry-policy#feature-retry-budget","repo":"jinxiqinghuan/dsh-retry-policy","commit":"6b3d3fa135935e7c4844bfd4f263da20e6577e6a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"模型重试策略的功能「重试预算」：模型请求失败时按设置的最大次数重试，也可配置为无限模式。达到有限预算后会把恢复决定交给下游处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:198-290"]}
